    <briefdescription>
<para>Unknown error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1UnknownError" kindref="compound">UnknownError</ref> represents an error where the underlying cause is unknown or could not be classified.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>UnknownError();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>UnknownError(&quot;Unexpected<sp/>failure<sp/>occurred&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
